igned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection point is  $P(1,12,-18).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/state.json" "file_sha256" "3e91084ca6463f8dfa40c9cf75a3f2dee88d00a005a7e2d68df60aa979f6909c" "basis" 1917 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74003" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9a0a0f737738e6614dcf54d88095202b82a3ce826a18d4819f8dc807f491c853" "basis" 1917 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74003" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/state.json" "file_sha256" "3e91084ca6463f8dfa40c9cf75a3f2dee88d00a005a7e2d68df60aa979f6909c" "basis" 1917 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74003" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "(0,1,-1)"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/state.json" "file_sha256" "3e91084ca6463f8dfa40c9cf75a3f2dee88d00a005a7e2d68df60aa979f6909c" "basis" 1917 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059450/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74003" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [: